name: ['Bottle Gnomes', 'Capsize', 'Crystalline Sliver', 'Disenchant', 'Goblin Bombardment', 'Krosan Tusker', 'Muscle Sliver', 'Priest of Titania', 'Scragnoth', 'Smother', 'Sparksmith', 'Whipcorder', 'Withered Wretch']
