text: ['All Sliver creatures get +1/+1.', "All Slivers have shroud. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", "Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nReturn target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Cycling {2}{G} ({2}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Krosan Tusker, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle. (Do this before you draw.)', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target creature with mana value 3 or less. It can't be regenerated.", 'Sacrifice Bottle Gnomes: You gain 3 life.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Goblin Bombardment deals 1 damage to any target.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nProtection from blue", '{1}: Exile target card from a graveyard.', '{T}: Add {G} for each Elf on the battlefield.', '{T}: Sparksmith deals X damage to target creature and X damage to you, where X is the number of Goblins on the battlefield.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.\\nMorph {W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)']
flavor: ['"I am reminded of the fable of the silver egg. Its owner cracks it open to see what jewels it holds, only to discover a simple yellow yolk."\\n—Karn, silver golem', '"I can\'t hear them scream, but at least I don\'t have to listen to them beg."\\n—Phage the Untouchable', '"If it didn\'t hurt, how would I know it worked?"', 'Bred as living shields, these slivers have proven unruly-they know they cannot be caught.', "His bolas whirl like galaxies, but it's his enemies who see stars.", 'It possesses no intelligence, only counter-intelligence.', 'Once it consecrated the dead. Now it desecrates them.', 'One mogg to aim the catapult, one mogg to steer the rock.', 'The air was filled with the cracks and snaps of flesh hardening as the new sliver joined the battle.', 'Titania rewards all who honor the forest by making them a living part of it.']
